    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "description": "驱动差异说明。",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 26 },
      "id": 11,
      "options": {
        "content": "**⚠️ 探测粒度按驱动不同（易误判）**\n\n- `sqlite`：`Ping()` 是真实 `db.Ping()`，磁盘写满 / 只读挂载会让 `s3c_store_up 0`。\n- `json` / `encrypted`：`Ping()` **恒为 nil**，存储故障**不会**让本面板变红，只会以写请求 5xx 暴露。\n\n此时请看「服务端 5xx 比例」+ 日志 `msg=\"handler error\"`。详见 OPERATIONS.md §3.1 与 §5 R-3。",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "targets": [],
